Install and play your games from Epic, GOG and Amazon

Heroic lets you log in to your Epic Games, GOG and Amazon Games accounts and install, update and play your games from one place. On Linux it runs Windows games through Wine or Proton.

- Install, update, repair and move games
- Run Windows games with Wine or Proton, and download extra versions of both
- Cloud save sync
- ProtonDB and Steam Deck compatibility information
- Import games you already installed
